{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7b_VUbXGVy1hLr3gnKysow","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:02.366532+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7b_VUbXGVy1hLr3gnKysow","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/FLIiakObRQLMj1AQr2M9arzvm7O1gqcVRichpywRUZ0rI6XBibXbf3N9jSHo6krsgNHmVogJGuV3GhmsdRTJ6h8Kw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>一、报名途径</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Ss5YRAPI5qwzuu3qLqhF8G3hszclypKO6eqkHoHdmdtIz0vqzzmiapSIkB8AM7ibIcC9UuEQ00SPc4YgzyzqymjVC5BBS5xrickodjjQbncnVA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>我校采取网上报名并提交电子材料方式接收申请，请符合申请条件的申请人（包括天津大学本校生）登录天津大学研究生招生信息网（yzb.tju.edu.cn）（服务系统-&gt;2027级推免硕士申请或https://sszs.tju.edu.cn/10056/user/login/login）填报信息。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>二、系统开放时间</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Ss5YRAPI5qzmmuO1xicxiaSzwOkKVO2QFwcLolicHkCjT8YjsPApUNGvwHog5ptcO5lgs6nPFcNRkcevDVdpvy1q70juTbnJB38xC8pzAIxFTs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>系统拟开闭时间：2026年7月7日中午12:00—2026年9月20日。</span></span></strong><span><span>如有变更，将在天津大学研招网（http://yzb.tju.edu.cn/）及时通知。</span></span></span><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Ss5YRAPI5qwIqpa11wKaWHzzDUiaWBZqDXXGFqClRflS8Iw6gEFcbhOQIcFWibyl2A04bTBbTGAZMRvUyz2mj4ZtsO0KQxaxNKibu8h5iaHr5iak/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>拥护中国共产党的领导、愿为祖国建设服务、品德良好、遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></p><p><span>1.在目前就读学校有机会取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生（含天津大学本校生）；</span></p><p><span>2.研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></p><p><span>3.诚实守信，学风端正，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></p><p><span>4.身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Ss5YRAPI5qyFC5ONljHaVhvEzpDibarsFO1djKtOeQtwMFZVhRV46G2WaecmoibTxv9lCib5SqNGOuCq8u9ffiasukzXNcHB0jTzSxel9W7FSew/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Ss5YRAPI5qzmDia8X1GbdzIc2icGMxX6FDvqGdNSfp06nx7QWPksPHp0ia82fwpBe01dNWs3LDw0iaqKu3BMd4hTTC5Xp8Oxib0qxo9CgwTMSXE0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、审核时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Ss5YRAPI5qzoREQqiaeS1b2cSTUaqCnFUwlsmvicCZprp177WhibDnPnJ7WK37pqtgnGj4PD8ibHld0W1vmxJh2UZG1hZ5R41JHvbJb6mIkh8I4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>8月18日；9月10日</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、其他说明</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Ss5YRAPI5qxnicEq5yevKAibXqZwsaibsrw5oQHCFdMQKMKH9XElaZbsx2xk8QbbEkpRLkYH5JcvaS6mfajtBEQCUTbpuC8XbkGyCr5wzk8vTo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 申请人必须保证提交的申请信息及全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。对在推免过程中存在弄虚作假、有违学术道德和专业伦理等不当行为的，或存在其他严重影响推免过程和结果公平公正行为的，一经查实，取消我校免试读研资格。</span></p><p><span>2. 我校将在录取当年5-6月对所有拟录取的推免生进行资格复审。通过资格复审后，方可被正式录取，我校予以发放录取通知书。未通过资格复审者，取消其研究生录取资格。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Ss5YRAPI5qxLHL8FjI1E7OP7MjwYGibzORg6mT5mwLxxy1mZuCoPsoWicpCia1IibKs4Ffgawniaickj58NVYqwOG5nyoVgxR0wtyUXrV83ll1f3o/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>联系电话：</span></strong><span>022-87370655 周老师</span></p><p><strong><span>邮箱：</span></strong><span>tjumarine@tju.edu.cn</span></p><p><strong><span>海洋学院招生QQ群：</span></strong><span>235048554（进群申请备注：姓名+意向报考专业）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>来源：海洋学院行政办公室</span></p><p><span>编辑：杨梦昕</span></p